---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'October 9, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Editorial Policy"
  description="Editorial Policy for CodesCompiler educational tutorials, programming examples, and technical content."
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-white shadow-sm my-8 rounded-lg">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4">Editorial Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-8"><strong>Last Updated:</strong> {lastUpdated}</p>

    <div class="prose prose-brand prose-lg max-w-none">
      <h2>Our Goal</h2>
      <p>
        CodesCompiler aims to publish practical, understandable, and useful educational
        content about web development, programming, computer science, SEO, and related
        technologies.
      </p>

      <h2>Content Standards</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>We aim to explain technical concepts clearly for the intended skill level.</li>
        <li>Examples are written and organized to help readers learn by doing.</li>
        <li>We review content for clarity, broken links, obvious errors, and outdated information when updates are identified.</li>
        <li>We may revise articles as programming languages, browsers, libraries, tools, and best practices evolve.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Corrections and Updates</h2>
      <p>
        Technology changes quickly. If you notice an inaccurate statement, outdated example,
        broken link, or other issue, please contact us with the page URL and the suggested
        correction. We may update the page after review.
      </p>

      <h2>Advertising and Editorial Independence</h2>
      <p>
        Advertising may help support the free availability of CodesCompiler. Advertisements
        are separate from editorial content, and advertising does not guarantee a favorable
        editorial treatment of a product, service, company, or technology.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Editorial corrections and suggestions can be sent to
        <a href="mailto:contact@codescompiler.com">contact@codescompiler.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
